    "name": "Clash of Rock Paper Scissors",
    "steam_appid": 3713160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713160/extras/49c555a3e298baeb573e7b123860a6e0.avif?t=1755102137\" width=616 height=210 /></span>Get ready for the ultimate twist on the classic game! <strong>Clash of Rock Paper Scissors</strong> is a fast-paced, shape-shifting arena brawler where quick thinking and strategy rule the battlefield. Transform between Rock, Paper, and Scissors in real time and outplay your opponents in chaotic multiplayer showdowns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Battles</strong> \u2013 Outsmart friends or bots in intense 1v1 or free-for-all matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Shape-Shifting</strong> \u2013 Switch between Rock, Paper, and Scissors with perfect timing to counter and strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online &amp; Offline Modes</strong> \u2013 Play solo, with friends locally, or online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Button Controls</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, hard to master\u2014perfect for players of all skill levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Game Vibes</strong> \u2013 Quick rounds, hilarious moments, and unpredictable fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Visuals</strong> \u2013 Colorful characters and arenas bring the chaos to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual player or a competitive strategist, <strong>Clash of Rock Paper Scissors</strong> offers fast, fun, and clever gameplay that keeps you coming back for more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713160/extras/49c555a3e298baeb573e7b123860a6e0.avif?t=1755102137\" width=616 height=210 /></span>Get ready for the ultimate twist on the classic game! <strong>Clash of Rock Paper Scissors</strong> is a fast-paced, shape-shifting arena brawler where quick thinking and strategy rule the battlefield. Transform between Rock, Paper, and Scissors in real time and outplay your opponents in chaotic multiplayer showdowns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Battles</strong> \u2013 Outsmart friends or bots in intense 1v1 or free-for-all matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Shape-Shifting</strong> \u2013 Switch between Rock, Paper, and Scissors with perfect timing to counter and strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online &amp; Offline Modes</strong> \u2013 Play solo, with friends locally, or online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Button Controls</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, hard to master\u2014perfect for players of all skill levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Game Vibes</strong> \u2013 Quick rounds, hilarious moments, and unpredictable fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Visuals</strong> \u2013 Colorful characters and arenas bring the chaos to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual player or a competitive strategist, <strong>Clash of Rock Paper Scissors</strong> offers fast, fun, and clever gameplay that keeps you coming back for more.</p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced multiplayer twist on the classic rock-paper-scissors game! Shape-shift in real time, outsmart opponents, and clash in colorful arenas. Easy to learn, fun to master\u2014perfect for quick battles with friends or smart AI.",
